  lines:
  - name: Eira
    text: Vamonos' Dance Competition! Just what I'm looking fo-
  - name: Eira
    text: "\u20B1100,000?!"
  - name: Eira
    text: That's two months of Eli's bills easy, maybe even three.
  - name: Eira
    text: "Entry fee of \u20B15,000? But that's all I have..."
  - name: Eira
    text: I should just send my money to Eli, this money's not mine to gamble.
  - name: Eira
    text: ...I'll think about it.
